# Daze's alternative cost needs "an Island you control": with only a Mountain in play it is refused (! Cast with
# Ability: Return an Island) at Bot2's first Duress, which takes the spare Lightning Bolt. On turn 3 Bot1 plays a Volcanic
# Island, an Island by its land type though not a basic one, and at the second Duress returns it to counter that
# Duress (the positive control: the same Daze with an Island in play); the Mountain stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Volcanic Island
Daze
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x3
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Duress
Duress
Swamp x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
! Bot1.Hand.Daze.Cast(Duress; Ability: Return an Island)
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Daze.Cast(Duress; Ability: Return an Island)
Bot1.Choose(Volcanic Island)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain
Bot1.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Volcanic Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Daze; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Graveyard = Duress; Duress
